WEBVTT

00:14.070 --> 00:17.010
♪Tear up all the memories of the past♪

00:18.200 --> 00:20.850
♪Let go of all regrets♪

00:20.850 --> 00:26.260
♪I exchange my whole life for a change♪

00:27.730 --> 00:31.280
♪If I decide to let my guard down♪

00:31.830 --> 00:36.120
♪Will I fall for the wrong one♪

00:37.080 --> 00:40.630
♪I dare to give
without fear of destruction♪

00:41.620 --> 00:43.830
♪Love refuses to fall asleep♪

00:43.830 --> 00:46.870
♪I dare to shake heaven and earth♪

00:46.870 --> 00:48.950
♪Even with different paths and goals♪

00:48.950 --> 00:53.010
♪I have no regrets♪

00:53.520 --> 00:58.290
♪Because you're
an unsolvable riddle by fate♪

00:58.290 --> 01:02.580
♪I pray for a miracle♪

01:02.580 --> 01:03.990
♪Over the time♪

01:03.990 --> 01:06.000
♪Even if I'm burned out♪

01:06.000 --> 01:08.850
♪I'm willing to search for the miracle♪

01:08.850 --> 01:12.120
♪Of being with you forever♪

01:12.120 --> 01:16.820
♪I will travel with you all the way♪

01:17.520 --> 01:25.170
♪Love is the most beautiful in life♪

01:37.840 --> 01:43.200
=Sword and Fairy=

01:43.600 --> 01:46.700
=Episode 13=

02:09.750 --> 02:13.070
Thank you, Miss Ming.
Thanks to your magic lamp, we escaped.

02:14.430 --> 02:15.530
Jinzhao.

02:26.160 --> 02:27.640
Why is there two of you?

02:41.480 --> 02:42.540
Qi.

02:45.750 --> 02:48.280
Jinzhao, I feel bad.

02:48.280 --> 02:49.760
I'll take you to rest.

02:49.760 --> 02:52.079
Jinzhao, let's find
a place to settle down.

02:53.550 --> 02:54.600
Let's go.

03:04.190 --> 03:06.360
Greetings, Didact.

03:07.230 --> 03:08.510
What is it?

03:08.510 --> 03:09.640
Didact,

03:09.640 --> 03:14.230
today, at the Zhengwu Alliance,
I saw those ruffians again.

03:14.230 --> 03:19.320
And that monster who killed
Zhenyao fish with a single blow.

03:20.360 --> 03:24.680
Didact, the Zhengwu Alliance
is the number one sect in the world.

03:25.440 --> 03:28.110
If that bunch of people
cooperate with them,

03:28.110 --> 03:29.870
it would likely be detrimental to us.

03:30.960 --> 03:34.720
But I used a little trick.

03:34.720 --> 03:38.000
I got someone to poison them
with the Huaxing Powder.

03:40.550 --> 03:44.440
If the Zhengwu Alliance knows
there's a demon among those people,

03:44.440 --> 03:46.000
their friendly relationship

03:46.000 --> 03:48.440
won't last long.

03:49.320 --> 03:50.470
So it was you.

03:54.350 --> 03:55.440
Gao Xiao.

03:55.440 --> 03:56.550
Yes.

03:56.550 --> 04:01.190
You've done a great job. I will secure
your succession as the sect leader.

04:02.470 --> 04:03.750
Thank you, Didact.

04:04.310 --> 04:08.470
I will repay your great kindness
even by risking my life.

04:09.950 --> 04:11.670
I'll take my leave.

04:14.880 --> 04:20.390
(Gao Xiao, I'll get back at you
on behalf of Qi.)

04:45.909 --> 04:51.030
Zhaoyan,
I've brought you trouble this time.

04:52.640 --> 04:56.360
How so? Without you today,

04:56.360 --> 04:59.470
we wouldn't know
Bian Luohuan's identity.

05:00.600 --> 05:03.640
And we don't care if you're a demon.

05:08.880 --> 05:10.000
That's what everyone thinks?

05:10.520 --> 05:14.920
Of course, although you're a wolf demon,
you're kind-hearted towards me...

05:19.390 --> 05:22.160
I mean, all of us.
And you help us a lot.

05:23.470 --> 05:24.620
You...

05:39.000 --> 05:40.000
And you? What do you think?

05:46.159 --> 05:49.830
To me, you are
a very loyal buddy and friend.

05:54.550 --> 05:55.560
Buddy?

05:58.360 --> 06:02.670
Well, at least you don't despise me
for being a demon.

06:10.550 --> 06:13.670
I've wanted to give this to you before.

06:18.440 --> 06:22.720
Thank you, but this hairpin
is something used by women.

06:29.000 --> 06:30.060
You knew?

06:31.830 --> 06:34.920
Yes, just as you know I am a demon.

06:35.630 --> 06:37.200
Senior, I...

06:37.200 --> 06:38.550
Zhaoyan, I...

06:40.350 --> 06:42.040
Senior Xian Qing, I brought you...

06:47.480 --> 06:50.550
I'm sorry.

06:52.350 --> 06:53.760
I'll put it here.

06:54.440 --> 06:56.000
Go ahead.

07:12.110 --> 07:13.760
You saved me anyway.

07:15.760 --> 07:17.600
A hairpin as a token of gratitude
isn't too much, right?

07:24.320 --> 07:27.480
In that case, I accept it.

07:47.440 --> 07:51.000
You mean he looks exactly the same?

07:53.320 --> 07:54.790
It's just that he has
a scar on his face.

07:56.920 --> 08:01.760
The Didact of the Qiyuan Sect
looks so much like me.

08:02.790 --> 08:04.200
Could it be that we are brothers?

08:06.040 --> 08:10.040
Then, wouldn't our investigation
into the Qiyuan Sect turn into a joke?

08:12.200 --> 08:14.760
You're wrong. Although Physician Bian...

08:16.760 --> 08:20.760
No, you're just you.
You are different from everyone else.

08:26.760 --> 08:29.110
Your eyes are brighter than his.

08:37.350 --> 08:38.480
You are also warmer than him.

08:48.670 --> 08:49.680
What's wrong?

08:55.950 --> 09:00.230
Qi, do you know
what's the deal with these scales?

09:03.480 --> 09:04.830
Why did they grow out again?

09:06.630 --> 09:07.690
Again?

09:09.600 --> 09:14.280
They grew after I consumed
the Qiyuan Orb at the Fujin Hall before.

09:15.000 --> 09:18.110
But they disappeared quickly,
so I didn't pay much attention.

09:19.670 --> 09:23.200
So I wasn't wrong
about what I saw by the Yinma River.

09:24.160 --> 09:25.720
They grew on me at that time too?

09:30.720 --> 09:35.790
Qi, don't you think
these scales are quite pretty?

09:37.880 --> 09:38.990
They are amazing.

09:43.720 --> 09:45.390
So, don't worry.

09:46.070 --> 09:47.280
You must remember

09:48.070 --> 09:50.950
not to show the scales to others
or tell anyone about them.

09:51.720 --> 09:53.550
Not even Zhaoyan?

09:53.550 --> 09:55.000
Isn't she our good friend?

09:55.000 --> 09:56.880
We can't let our good friends worry.

09:57.510 --> 09:58.760
We'll tell them

09:59.390 --> 10:00.760
after we find evidence, okay?

10:13.740 --> 10:16.560
(Hundred-Foot Spring Platform,
Yujie Hub)

10:48.630 --> 10:49.680
Do you realize your mistake?

10:52.240 --> 10:55.510
It was my fault that I let
Yue Jinzhao knock off my mask,

10:56.680 --> 10:57.680
but I don't regret it.

11:00.430 --> 11:01.480
Luohuan!

11:03.600 --> 11:04.920
Huan.

11:04.920 --> 11:08.390
Please, Huan did it to save Qi,
so that's why...

11:13.600 --> 11:16.360
If you had left immediately
after rescuing her,

11:16.990 --> 11:18.480
they wouldn't have seen your face.

11:25.070 --> 11:26.560
According to the rules of our sect,

11:27.070 --> 11:29.800
what punishment should one receive
for deliberate violation?

11:30.830 --> 11:33.680
They shall be punished with thunder.

12:06.830 --> 12:07.950
Luohuan!

12:07.950 --> 12:09.750
Xiaoyuan, don't.

12:10.430 --> 12:13.280
It'll just make things worse.

12:18.360 --> 12:23.190
Before, Qingfei concealed your breach
of oath in the Luori Village.

12:23.990 --> 12:26.830
I turned a blind eye and let it pass

12:27.830 --> 12:31.120
because you did not affect our plan.

12:32.120 --> 12:35.070
But this time, you exposed your face.

12:35.070 --> 12:38.510
Our plan may very well
be ruined because of it.

12:39.680 --> 12:40.750
Xuwei,

12:42.950 --> 12:45.990
it was I who broke the vow.
I admit all my faults.

12:46.800 --> 12:49.240
You are all talking.
You don't admit in your heart at all.

12:50.600 --> 12:55.830
Now the one who's intertwined
with Qi's fate is Yue Jinzhao. Not you.

13:11.870 --> 13:13.750
Yue Jinzhao exists because of you.

13:15.480 --> 13:16.830
For Qi,

13:19.800 --> 13:23.160
you are the past. He is the future.

13:24.040 --> 13:25.920
When will you understand?

13:28.720 --> 13:30.070
I know it all along,

13:32.040 --> 13:37.310
but I don't want to.

13:47.920 --> 13:48.990
Luohuan!

13:48.990 --> 13:51.070
Xiaoyuan, don't go over.

13:53.160 --> 13:57.040
Xuwei, please, just spare Huan!

13:57.990 --> 13:59.510
It's not that I refuse
to go easy on him.

14:00.430 --> 14:02.600
It's that he won't go easy on himself.

14:04.190 --> 14:07.190
Luohuan, I'm asking you again.

14:08.190 --> 14:09.360
Do you recognize your mistake?

14:10.950 --> 14:14.280
I made no mistake,
so how can I recognize it?

14:16.190 --> 14:17.290
Huan.

14:18.800 --> 14:19.880
Fine.

14:21.290 --> 14:26.320
♪The distance
that can't be crossed is fate♪

14:26.920 --> 14:29.040
♪If love arises with the wind♪

14:29.040 --> 14:32.620
♪How do I calm it♪

14:33.200 --> 14:35.500
♪I've given it my all♪

14:35.500 --> 14:39.210
♪But our paths just don't cross♪

14:39.210 --> 14:41.610
♪Look, the leaves are falling like rain♪

14:42.720 --> 14:43.880
Luohuan!

14:45.950 --> 14:47.360
Huan, are you okay?

14:49.040 --> 14:50.360
Xiaoyuan, I'm fine.

14:50.360 --> 14:53.310
You're lying. You were struck
by lightning. How can you be fine?

15:02.040 --> 15:03.680
- Ming Xiu's tea smells nice.
- Yue. Little Yue.

15:11.120 --> 15:12.140
Be careful. It's hot.

15:12.830 --> 15:14.560
Thanks, you're so kind.

15:15.240 --> 15:17.190
By the way, how is Senior Xian Qing?

15:18.600 --> 15:21.740
Didn't you agree we'd be buddies?
Why are you still calling me senior?

15:22.920 --> 15:24.040
Okay, Xian Qing.

15:26.070 --> 15:27.560
I'll call you by your name
from now on too.

15:28.870 --> 15:31.360
Little Yue, you must
take revenge for me.

15:32.040 --> 15:34.430
Of course. Jinzhao and I
have already made an arrangement.

15:34.430 --> 15:36.120
This time, we must
eliminate the Qiyuan Sect.

15:40.950 --> 15:45.950
Everyone, about that Bian Luohuan
who looks just like me...

15:46.560 --> 15:49.950
Jinzhao, you are you and he is him.
We can tell the difference.

15:51.680 --> 15:52.680
Thanks a lot.

15:53.280 --> 15:57.160
But you and Bian Luohuan
look like twins.

15:57.160 --> 16:00.390
We might not tell who's who
by the looks, but I...

16:04.120 --> 16:05.830
But we know well

16:05.830 --> 16:08.040
that you and Bian Luohuan
are fundamentally different.

16:10.280 --> 16:12.160
Let's think about
what we should do next.

16:12.990 --> 16:14.510
Previously, at the Fujin Hall,

16:14.510 --> 16:16.870
the Qiyuan Sect said
the Didact wanted to capture us.

16:17.430 --> 16:20.160
Later, at the Fengyan Inn, they
identified Bian Luohuan as the Didact.

16:21.070 --> 16:24.680
I have always suspected Bian Luohuan
is plotting against me and Qi.

16:25.800 --> 16:28.720
But I don't know his exact purpose yet.

16:30.800 --> 16:32.480
We will continue
to investigate the Qiyuan Sect

16:32.480 --> 16:33.480
and catch Bian Luohuan.

16:34.630 --> 16:38.950
Right, now we only have
a clue about the crystal.

16:38.950 --> 16:41.360
And the crystal is
in the mechanism box of the Qiyuan Sect.

16:41.360 --> 16:42.990
Then it must be related to the sect.

16:43.510 --> 16:45.870
He also appeared in the Wuyan Village,
where Qi and I woke up.

16:46.630 --> 16:49.360
In addition, I bear
a strong resemblance to Bian Luohuan.

16:50.600 --> 16:52.630
Let's just go back to the village

16:52.630 --> 16:54.040
and ask Mrs. Shi.

16:57.310 --> 16:58.510
Little Yue has really grown up.

17:31.680 --> 17:32.720
How is Luohuan?

17:33.240 --> 17:35.190
He has taken his medicine
and gone to sleep.

17:38.360 --> 17:41.600
Actually, it hasn't been easy for him.

17:42.750 --> 17:44.310
Back then, to keep Zhu Yu in check,

17:45.720 --> 17:48.190
after those from the Sea
of Clear Skies entrusted Qi to us,

17:50.310 --> 17:52.510
Huan accompanied her for over a decade.

17:53.040 --> 17:56.040
He always took care of her
and taught her with patience.

17:56.830 --> 17:59.560
That was because Qi only
wanted to be close to him.

18:02.310 --> 18:05.870
Later, Qi disappeared,
and when she came back,

18:05.870 --> 18:08.160
Yue Jinzhao was by her side.

18:09.390 --> 18:14.920
You thought Qi had a far deeper bond
with Yue Jinzhao than with Huan,

18:15.720 --> 18:18.390
so you let the two of them
stay in the Mortal Realm

18:19.310 --> 18:22.430
and Huan was thus permanently replaced.

18:28.280 --> 18:30.120
That still can't be a reason
for him to break his vow.

18:31.720 --> 18:34.120
Huan is not one to wallow in self-pity.

18:35.720 --> 18:37.160
He can accept this.

18:38.310 --> 18:40.920
But he'd feel inevitably salty about it.

18:42.630 --> 18:45.630
Please don't blame him.

18:57.350 --> 19:01.710
You should know I never blame you guys.

19:29.200 --> 19:30.800
No way.

19:40.840 --> 19:41.960
Shifang, what are you looking at?

19:44.110 --> 19:45.160
Shh.

19:45.160 --> 19:46.190
What's wrong?

19:47.800 --> 19:52.160
Didn't you say last time
that Zhaoyan and Xian Qing...?

19:54.280 --> 19:56.230
Anyway, are they really...?

19:56.960 --> 19:58.030
Yeah.

20:00.320 --> 20:04.630
Do you not think that they're...?

20:04.630 --> 20:05.640
Well-matched.

20:08.080 --> 20:11.040
Wretched? We are
all good friends, Little Yue.

20:11.040 --> 20:12.710
No need to diss them.

20:14.510 --> 20:17.750
Shifang, it was "well-matched",
not "wretched".

20:19.710 --> 20:20.810
Match...

20:35.870 --> 20:37.590
Are you still hesitating

20:37.590 --> 20:39.280
about whether to tell
everyone you're a woman?

20:45.200 --> 20:47.680
I've gotten used to being seen as a man.

20:48.280 --> 20:49.920
Spitting the truth about being a woman

20:51.390 --> 20:52.470
feels somewhat difficult.

20:55.080 --> 20:56.710
But we are thick-and-thin friends.

20:57.350 --> 20:58.380
I shouldn't keep it a secret.

21:05.630 --> 21:06.640
Let's go.

21:09.560 --> 21:10.640
Miss Yue.

21:14.680 --> 21:15.960
Miss Yue, Shifang.

21:17.230 --> 21:21.630
Sorry, actually, I'm a girl.

21:21.630 --> 21:24.470
Girls' clothes are so pretty. Zhaoyan,
you should wear them more often.

21:27.160 --> 21:32.160
I mistook you and Xian Qing as...

21:34.990 --> 21:38.080
But now it seems
I wasn't totally mistaken.

21:40.470 --> 21:42.710
No, I was wrong.

21:43.870 --> 21:45.840
Was I wrong or not?

21:46.710 --> 21:48.990
It's just that before, you...

21:48.990 --> 21:51.440
Shifang, let's go.
You really are verbose.

21:51.440 --> 21:53.390
Wait, s-s-she really is a girl?

21:56.990 --> 21:58.090
They already knew?

22:00.160 --> 22:01.840
Whether you present yourself

22:02.470 --> 22:05.350
as a man or a woman,
it's your own affair.

22:05.990 --> 22:07.080
As long as you like it.

22:33.710 --> 22:34.800
Jinzhao.

22:35.800 --> 22:36.880
What's the matter?

22:37.680 --> 22:40.990
What's wrong? Are you
still thinking about Bian Luohuan?

22:42.750 --> 22:45.320
I'm wondering

22:45.990 --> 22:48.080
if he is my twin brother or not.

22:50.230 --> 22:53.160
Bian Luohuan, you and I.

22:53.680 --> 22:55.960
What kind of relationship
do the three of us have?

23:05.710 --> 23:06.730
What are you doing?

23:07.350 --> 23:08.840
Why think so much?

23:08.840 --> 23:10.590
During the past three years,

23:10.590 --> 23:12.590
haven't we been taking it
one day at a time?

23:17.590 --> 23:19.320
What's wrong? Did I say something wrong?

23:19.320 --> 23:21.390
You're particularly right.

23:23.920 --> 23:24.970
We're in the Wuyan Village now.

23:41.920 --> 23:43.990
Didn't we come here
the last time we visited the Pureness?

23:46.160 --> 23:48.680
So the village is right below it.

23:55.790 --> 23:56.800
Be careful.

23:56.800 --> 23:59.350
Jinzhao, I never thought
we would come back.

23:59.350 --> 24:01.200
Yes, it's just like a dream.

24:03.990 --> 24:05.630
(Wuyan Village)
All houses have been renovated.

24:05.630 --> 24:06.990
Life is much better than before.

24:08.320 --> 24:10.440
This really is a place of peace.

24:11.080 --> 24:13.750
Yes, and the people here
were really nice to us.

24:15.110 --> 24:16.230
Miss Yue, you've returned.

24:32.010 --> 24:33.040
Come on.

24:33.040 --> 24:34.060
Isn't that...?

24:35.080 --> 24:36.990
Go, hurry.

24:36.990 --> 24:38.630
Shifang, what do you
want to eat in a bit?

24:39.710 --> 24:44.230
I want to eat...

24:45.750 --> 24:46.760
Egg noodles.

24:47.680 --> 24:48.960
Egg noodles.

24:48.960 --> 24:50.160
Let's go back first.

24:51.560 --> 24:52.960
Where is your house then?

24:53.840 --> 24:54.840
The most dilapidated one.

24:54.840 --> 24:55.850
Let's go.

25:11.920 --> 25:14.390
3 years ago, Jinzhao
and I lived right here.

25:15.870 --> 25:18.840
It seems life wasn't easy for you two.

25:19.800 --> 25:22.230
Back then, Jinzhao
and I relied on each other.

25:22.230 --> 25:25.040
There was only this house here,
so we lived together.

25:37.200 --> 25:39.470
Back then, he was handsy.

25:39.990 --> 25:40.990
What are you saying?

25:42.230 --> 25:43.800
Why are you covering my mouth again?

25:43.800 --> 25:47.110
Aren't you afraid I'll tell everyone
about how you were always taking my bed?

25:47.750 --> 25:49.630
You made it sound a bit strange.
Do you realize that?

25:49.630 --> 25:52.590
What's so strange?
You always took my bed back then.

25:53.920 --> 25:55.110
Alright, let's talk business.

25:57.320 --> 25:59.390
Then let's clean up this place.

25:59.390 --> 26:01.080
Let's rest here tonight.

26:01.080 --> 26:02.160
Okay.

26:04.040 --> 26:06.870
Those three villagers earlier
were carrying this type of crystal.

26:07.680 --> 26:09.840
Back then, Jinzhao used
this kind of crystal

26:09.840 --> 26:11.680
to exchange for our travel expenses
out of the village.

26:11.680 --> 26:12.800
It's quite valuable.

26:13.470 --> 26:15.510
This crystal can also
make Dou Bao stronger.

26:19.350 --> 26:21.350
This village used to be extremely poor.

26:22.680 --> 26:25.470
But now, it's much better
than before we left.

26:27.040 --> 26:29.750
It seems that the villagers
have been selling

26:29.750 --> 26:31.200
crystals to the Qiyuan Sect in secret.

26:31.960 --> 26:33.560
That's how they revived the village.

26:35.390 --> 26:38.040
But the villagers all seem very kind.

26:38.800 --> 26:40.160
How could they do such a thing?

26:41.200 --> 26:43.280
Maybe they don't even know

26:43.280 --> 26:44.870
what the Qiyuan Sect have done.

26:44.870 --> 26:47.800
Qi is right. This village
is located in a remote area.

26:48.920 --> 26:51.710
They just want to improve their lives.

26:51.710 --> 26:54.280
If the villagers
are in cahoots with the sect,

26:54.840 --> 26:57.870
it would be difficult for us
to get any information out of them.

27:00.470 --> 27:01.590
Rather than asking the villagers,

27:02.680 --> 27:04.510
it's better to lure out
the person behind them.

27:05.390 --> 27:09.960
Yes, we can do it with the crystals.

27:10.510 --> 27:11.920
How do we do it?

27:11.920 --> 27:13.080
Let's start with Mrs. Shi.

27:13.920 --> 27:15.320
She's in charge
of the village's affairs.

27:16.320 --> 27:18.560
If the village really has something
to do with the Qiyuan Sect,

27:18.560 --> 27:19.630
she must be aware of it.

27:21.750 --> 27:22.830
You're really clever.

27:29.160 --> 27:30.190
- Mrs. Shi.
- Mrs. Shi.

27:35.320 --> 27:37.840
Yue and Qi!

27:39.390 --> 27:40.560
How come you're here?

27:41.590 --> 27:45.510
Let me have a look.
You've grown more and more beautiful.

27:45.510 --> 27:48.870
Mrs. Shi, we want to ask about
something from three years ago.

27:48.870 --> 27:50.110
Something from three years ago?

27:50.110 --> 27:53.630
Yes, three years ago,
did you see someone

27:53.630 --> 27:54.870
who looked exactly like me?

27:55.800 --> 27:57.680
Someone who looked exactly like you?

27:58.990 --> 28:01.350
No, I haven't seen such a person.
Why do you ask?

28:03.750 --> 28:07.280
What about Mr. Lin Yuan?
He was the one who found us in the mine

28:07.280 --> 28:08.510
and brought us to the village.

28:09.840 --> 28:12.680
I know. He stayed in this village

28:12.680 --> 28:14.590
with you for a while.

28:15.350 --> 28:18.680
But he left right after you did.

28:18.680 --> 28:22.920
Right, it seems someone
spotted him near the mine.

28:23.560 --> 28:25.680
You guys can go there to look for him.

28:27.990 --> 28:29.710
There's one more thing, Mrs. Shi.

28:29.710 --> 28:32.440
We came here to investigate
the Dragon Crystals in this village.

28:38.320 --> 28:41.920
This crystal was found
at the stronghold of the Qiyuan Sect.

28:42.630 --> 28:44.800
I-I-I don't know anything
about what you're saying.

28:44.800 --> 28:47.920
Mrs. Shi, the Qiyuan Sect
has committed many evils.

28:48.680 --> 28:49.770
You mustn't help them.

28:50.350 --> 28:52.630
Mrs. Shi, please tell us.

28:54.960 --> 28:58.680
I-I-I have no idea.

28:58.680 --> 29:00.870
Don't inquire about this matter anymore.

29:00.870 --> 29:03.230
Hurry and leave.

29:03.230 --> 29:04.330
- Mrs. Shi.
- Mrs. Shi.

29:11.040 --> 29:12.110
Come.

29:36.470 --> 29:37.870
Judging from Mrs. Shi's reaction,

29:37.870 --> 29:39.920
the village must be
in collusion with the Qiyuan Sect.

29:40.560 --> 29:42.230
And she refused to say anything.

29:44.280 --> 29:45.320
Let's split up.

29:46.130 --> 29:47.150
- Okay.
- Hmm.

29:48.230 --> 29:51.440
Luo, Miss Ming, Shifang,
you guys go look over there.

29:51.440 --> 29:52.440
Qi and I will take this side.

29:59.750 --> 30:01.840
Is there really something fishy
about Mrs. Shi?

30:03.750 --> 30:04.780
I'm not sure either.

30:05.750 --> 30:07.080
It doesn't seem like it.

30:11.390 --> 30:12.510
Senior Xian Qing?

30:17.080 --> 30:22.320
Xian Qing,
you're top-notch in disguising.

30:28.680 --> 30:32.350
I can't understand you, Xian Qing.
Can you speak human language?

30:33.350 --> 30:36.040
He's probably saying...

30:36.040 --> 30:37.040
Saying what?

30:37.040 --> 30:38.060
He says,

30:40.590 --> 30:43.750
why do you guys make the same mistake
as Zhaoyan, mistaking the wrong dog?

30:46.800 --> 30:48.840
Speaking of surveillance,
I'll stay behind.

30:49.680 --> 30:51.200
So, will you turn into
a dog to keep watch?

30:52.230 --> 30:54.840
What? Xian Qing is a high-level demon.

30:54.840 --> 30:56.230
How could he use such lowly tricks?

30:56.800 --> 30:58.320
What is a high-level demon?

30:59.080 --> 31:00.230
Don't ask so many questions.

31:01.590 --> 31:02.600
Demonic aura.

31:05.350 --> 31:06.440
Let's go take a look.

31:16.230 --> 31:17.320
Stop!

31:25.550 --> 31:26.600
Mr. Lin.

31:27.160 --> 31:28.200
You almost scared me to death.

31:28.960 --> 31:31.040
Qi? Yue?

31:32.230 --> 31:33.230
What are you doing here?

31:33.230 --> 31:34.960
Mr. Lin, what are you doing here?

31:35.710 --> 31:38.160
I-I-I was just passing by
the Wuyan Village

31:38.160 --> 31:39.800
so I came in for a stroll
and bumped into you.

31:40.800 --> 31:42.200
Then did you just notice

31:42.200 --> 31:43.470
someone suspicious passing by?

31:44.440 --> 31:46.750
Suspicious people? No.

31:48.870 --> 31:50.350
We lost them.

31:50.350 --> 31:52.350
Mr. Lin, I want to ask you something.

31:52.350 --> 31:53.420
Go ahead.

31:54.350 --> 31:56.320
When you found us three years ago,

31:56.320 --> 31:57.560
were there other people around us?

31:59.960 --> 32:01.990
Why do you suddenly ask this?

32:01.990 --> 32:04.110
Mr. Lin, please think carefully.

32:04.110 --> 32:05.990
This is very important for Jinzhao.

32:05.990 --> 32:09.160
Was there someone
who looked exactly like me?

32:10.630 --> 32:13.160
No, when I found you at the entrance
of the village three years ago,

32:13.160 --> 32:14.160
you were just lying there.

32:14.160 --> 32:16.280
I thought you were dead.
It gave me quite a fright.

32:16.280 --> 32:18.160
But later on, I found out
you were all right,

32:18.160 --> 32:19.390
so I brought you to the village.

32:20.920 --> 32:23.040
Qi, how have you been these three years?

32:23.040 --> 32:26.040
Over the years,
Jinzhao and I have been traveling.

32:26.040 --> 32:28.990
We've been to many places
and eaten lots of delicious food.

32:28.990 --> 32:30.630
And we've made many good friends.

32:30.630 --> 32:33.200
You've even made friends! That's great.

32:35.280 --> 32:37.680
Yue, don't be so anxious.

32:37.680 --> 32:39.350
You're always chasing after

32:39.350 --> 32:41.710
things out of reach.

32:41.710 --> 32:44.390
Smell the roses
and the people around you.

32:44.390 --> 32:46.200
Cherish the present, right?

32:47.440 --> 32:50.120
I've been staying nearby recently.
Come to me if you're in need.

32:50.120 --> 32:51.160
Goodbye, Mr. Lin.

32:51.160 --> 32:52.750
Okay, I'm leaving.

33:04.510 --> 33:05.610
Let's go.

33:09.840 --> 33:14.110
I don't know why Yue and Qi returned.

33:14.750 --> 33:17.990
Since three years ago, we started
gathering the Dragon Crystals,

33:17.990 --> 33:20.440
I-I-I've always had it in my mind
not to let others

33:21.160 --> 33:23.990
know what we're doing,
just like you said.

33:39.160 --> 33:41.040
But now they've tracked it
all the way here.

33:43.350 --> 33:46.040
Yue and Qi are innocent.

33:46.040 --> 33:48.390
Please have mercy and let them go.

33:52.510 --> 33:54.990
If you don't want everyone
in your village to die,

33:56.230 --> 33:57.750
then do as I say.

34:07.510 --> 34:08.989
Why hasn't Xian Qing returned yet?

34:11.280 --> 34:12.679
Zhaoyan, are you worried about me?

34:19.920 --> 34:20.940
I smell a demon.

34:21.510 --> 34:22.960
Because we went to chase a demon.

34:24.080 --> 34:27.110
No, you must have come
into contact with a demon

34:27.110 --> 34:28.679
as it's such a strong demonic aura.

34:29.679 --> 34:33.750
And it is similar to that of Shuo Xuan
we encountered in the Luori Village.

34:35.710 --> 34:37.350
M-M-Miss Shuo Xuan?

34:39.469 --> 34:44.199
Miss and Mr. Yue, you said
you ran into Lin Yuan

34:44.199 --> 34:45.710
while going after a demon.

34:48.469 --> 34:49.870
Could it be that Mr. Lin is a demon?

34:57.160 --> 34:58.840
I've always considered him my savior.

35:01.110 --> 35:03.840
Today, I saw he was wearing
a scale just like Shuo Xuan's.

35:04.510 --> 35:05.560
Is he really in on it?

35:08.680 --> 35:11.200
Doesn't that mean they saved us twice?

35:11.200 --> 35:13.990
Once was when we woke up
in the Wuyan Village,

35:13.990 --> 35:15.590
and another time by the Yinma River.

35:17.280 --> 35:18.630
Why didn't they tell us?

35:20.320 --> 35:22.110
I've always suspected
Shuo Xuan knows you.

35:23.750 --> 35:25.800
If Mr. Lin and Shuo Xuan
are in it together,

35:26.390 --> 35:27.800
he must know our origins,

35:28.710 --> 35:30.710
but he watched us bustle about
without saying a word.

35:32.390 --> 35:35.080
Why is he doing this to us?

35:40.440 --> 35:42.040
Don't be so nervous.

35:42.040 --> 35:45.320
How about I go capture Mr. Lin
and torture him to spill the truth

35:45.320 --> 35:46.390
about our origins?

35:47.680 --> 35:50.280
Torturing him? Can you really do it?

35:51.110 --> 35:52.120
Seems like I can't.

35:52.800 --> 35:55.400
Lin Yuan seems
to have been watching us in secret.

35:55.990 --> 35:58.840
Let's see what he's really up to first.

36:01.190 --> 36:03.880
And that person
behind Mrs. Shi has appeared.

36:04.600 --> 36:06.840
They call this kind of rock
the Dragon Crystal.

36:06.840 --> 36:09.320
They also planned
to lead us to the mine tomorrow.

36:09.840 --> 36:12.080
Someone will be waiting for us there.

36:13.950 --> 36:17.510
Alright, it seems
the mastermind is coming out.

36:17.510 --> 36:21.040
Qi. Yue.

36:21.770 --> 36:22.840
Mrs. Shi.

36:22.840 --> 36:23.880
- Yue.
- Mrs. Shi.

36:23.880 --> 36:24.940
Qi.

36:28.120 --> 36:29.160
Please have a seat.

36:30.840 --> 36:31.880
No, thanks.

36:37.510 --> 36:42.280
The crystals are
at the location marked on this map.

36:43.800 --> 36:45.880
The buyer will go to the mine tomorrow.

36:46.950 --> 36:50.120
Come tomorrow.

36:57.750 --> 37:01.400
Alright, since the Qiyuan Sect
has set a trap for us,

37:01.400 --> 37:03.840
let's beat them at their own game.

37:04.750 --> 37:05.770
(Map)

37:10.420 --> 37:12.080
(Map)

37:48.820 --> 37:52.340
♪A meteor streaking across the sky♪

37:53.840 --> 37:57.130
♪Burns what once was♪

37:57.900 --> 38:00.750
♪The name is forgotten♪

38:04.850 --> 38:08.650
♪The deep feelings are hidden
behind the mask♪

38:09.870 --> 38:12.780
♪Only through the eyes♪

38:13.620 --> 38:17.160
♪Who can see them clearly♪

38:18.800 --> 38:25.450
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

38:26.670 --> 38:33.520
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

38:34.860 --> 38:42.800
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

38:42.800 --> 38:49.770
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

39:06.800 --> 39:10.800
♪The seemingly random paths♪

39:11.860 --> 39:15.340
♪The burning traces♪

39:15.860 --> 39:20.140
♪Behind them are all secrets♪

39:22.740 --> 39:27.180
♪Those unexpected encounters♪

39:27.890 --> 39:31.210
♪Are all carefully♪

39:31.820 --> 39:35.880
♪Arranged by me♪

39:36.850 --> 39:44.200
♪I'm destined
to brave all dangers for you♪

39:44.780 --> 39:51.790
♪Even if I cannot escape fate
in the end♪

39:51.790 --> 40:00.780
♪I gave up everything
for a moment of heartfelt resonance♪

40:00.780 --> 40:08.040
♪Leaving love
with an unspoken explanation♪

40:08.810 --> 40:16.240
♪I'm destined to give my all for you♪

40:16.810 --> 40:24.200
♪Even if my efforts may go up in smoke♪

40:24.880 --> 40:32.400
♪I am madly in love with you
and will do everything for you♪

40:32.940 --> 40:42.480
♪Leaving behind proof of my love♪
